e our impl against the spec'.", "input": {"hint": "instructions"}}, {"name": "review", "description": "Review the pending changes (current branch diff by default) in an isolated subagent — flags correctness, security, missing tests, hidden behavior changes; reports a verdict + per-issue file:line. Read-only.", "input": {"hint": "instructions"}}, {"name": "security-review", "description": "Security-focused review of the current branch diff in an isolated subagent — flags injection/authz/secrets/deserialization/path-traversal/crypto issues, severity-tagged. Read-only.", "input": {"hint": "instructions"}}, {"name": "test", "description": "Run the project's test suite, diagnose failures, propose+apply fixes, re-run until green (or stop after 2 attempts on the same failure). Inlined — runs in the parent loop. Detects go/npm/pnpm/yarn/pytest/cargo.", "input": {"hint": "instructions"}}], "sessionUpdate": "available_commands_update"}, "case_id": "ir-reasonix-8811-v1", "input_id": "step-1", "invocation_id": "7e9bb394b5664453a2ed9cb541d0879b", "agent_id": "reasonix"}}
